  ('p','**Is the Evac+Chair 400H a power stair chair?**'),
  ('p','No. The 400H has no motor or battery. It is a manual evacuation chair that uses self-braking tracks to control the speed of descent. For a powered stair climber, Evac+Chair makes the battery powered Power 800 and Power 900.'),
  ('p','**How is the 400H different from the 300H?**'),
